          "rawSql": "SELECT $__timeInterval(ts) AS time, protocol, 100*sumIf(value_ms, event='stall_end')/greatest(sumIf(value_ms, event='heartbeat'),1) AS stall_per_100s FROM qoe.events WHERE $__timeFilter(ts) AND room_id IN (${room:singlequote}) AND cdn IN (${cdn:singlequote}) AND protocol IN (${protocol:singlequote}) GROUP BY time, protocol ORDER BY time",
